Industry"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Businesses in the Travel sector often struggle with low open rates on emails and SMS messages getting lost in spam folders. Furthermore, maintaining personalized communication at scale while ensuring data security and timely responses presents a significant operational hurdle for many growing companies."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","1",{"id":"section-1","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"How Travel Businesses Use WhatsApp Successfully"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Successful Travel companies use WhatsApp not just for broadcasting, but for building conversational journeys. They send personalized product recommendations, automated service updates, and interactive feedback requests, turning a simple messaging app into a comprehensive customer relationship tool."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2",{"id":"section-2","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Key WhatsApp Marketing Strategies for Travel"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"Top strategies include setting up automated onboarding sequences, utilizing interactive list messages for quick service selection, and deploying intelligent chatbots for 24/7 preliminary support. Segmenting the audience based on past interactions is also crucial for delivering relevant content."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","3",{"id":"section-3","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-32","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-gray-100","children":"Setting Up WhatsApp Marketing for Your Travel Business"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","chil